GAP: financial_ratios row count = 1041, target >= 1100
CATEGORY: data source issue
DETAIL: 15 (company_id, year) pairs missing from balancesheet, 17 missing from
cashflow — concentrated in SBIN and HAL. Root cause not fixable without access
