GAP: capex_cr column is NULL for all rows
CATEGORY: data source issue
DETAIL: No dedicated CapEx column exists in cashflow or any other table.
investing_activity was considered as a proxy but rejected — it includes
non-CapEx items (asset sales, investment changes) and would misrepresent
actual capital expenditure. Requires a new data source to compute correctly.

GAP: book_value_per_share is NULL for all rows
CATEGORY: data source issue
DETAIL: Requires shares-outstanding data, which does not exist in any of the
12 source tables. Mathematically uncomputable from available data.

GAP: composite_quality_score is NULL for all rows
CATEGORY: formula undefined
DETAIL: Sprint 2 spec references this column but does not define its formula
or weighting methodology. Left unpopulated pending team decision, rather
than shipping an unvalidated custom formula as if authoritative.


